{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a6e9abf9f2b18b66a3d18f7888eb972005db7cc9695e64c58c95480a09f6f5a7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天使與小書卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看見另一位大能天使從天而降。他身披雲霞，頭頂彩虹，臉如太陽，雙腿如火柱，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["手中拿著一卷打開了的小書卷，右腳踏在海中，左腳踏在地上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他大聲呼喊，聲如獅吼，呼喊之後有七聲雷鳴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我正要將雷鳴的意思記錄下來，就聽見天上有聲音說：「你要封住七聲雷鳴所說的事，別寫下來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我剛才所見的那位腳踏海洋和陸地的天使向天舉起右手，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["憑著活到永永遠遠、創造天地海洋和其中一切的上帝起誓說：「必不再耽延了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["等第七位天使吹響號角時，上帝奧祕的計劃就實現了，正如上帝向祂的奴僕——眾先知所宣告的。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["先前從天上對我說話的聲音又吩咐我：「你去，從那位腳踏海洋陸地的天使手中把展開的小書卷拿來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["於是，我走到天使面前，請他將小書卷給我。他對我說：「拿去吃了。你的腹中會感到苦澀，可是你口中會覺得甘甜如蜜。」",{"noteId":16}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我就從天使手中接過小書卷，吃了，口中果然甘甜如蜜，吃完後腹中覺得苦澀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["那天使又對我說：「你必要再對許多民族、國家、語言族群和君王說預言。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"以西結書3·3。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}